      "heading": "Menghapus Group",
      "id": "delete-group",
      "intro": "Group yang tidak diperlukan bisa dihapus. Penting: menghapus group tidak selalu menghapus node di dalamnya.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Ungroup vs Delete",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Ungroup** (aman) — Klik kanan → Ungroup, border group hilang, node tetap utuh\n• **Delete Group** — Pilih group → Delete, group dan semua isinya terhapus\n• Rekomendasi: pakai **Ungroup** kalau masih butuh node-nya",
          "color": "#ef4444",
          "bg": "#fef2f2",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:8px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px\"><span style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#f0fdf4;color:#16a34a;font-size:7px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #bbf7d0\">Ungroup</span><span style=\"font-size:7px;color:#475569\">→ Node tetap ada ✓</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px\"><span style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#fef2f2;color:#dc2626;font-size:7px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid #fecaca\">Delete</span><span style=\"font-size:7px;color:#475569\">→ Hapus semua ✗</span></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Yang Perlu Diperhatikan",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Group kosong — hapus saja\n• Ctrl+Z bisa mengembalikan group yang terhapus\n• Kalau ragu, Ungroup lebih aman daripada Delete",
          "color": "#f97316",
          "bg": "#fff7ed",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:8px;background:#fff7ed;border:1px solid #fed7aa;padding:8px 10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d97706\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 8v4m0 4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:7px;color:#c2410c\">Ungroup lebih aman daripada Delete</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d97706\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 8v4m0 4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:7px;color:#c2410c\">Ctrl+Z untuk undo</span></div></div>"
